  "expertises-hero-text-html": "Innovorder for <strong>corporate</strong> <strong>catering</strong>",
  "text-17px-html": "\n            <p>Optimize the organization of your restaurant or company canteen whatever your sector of activity. </p>\n            <p>Fill the room with innovative solutions that meet the expectations of your guests and your kitchen teams!</p>\n          ",
  "image-hero-expertise-src": "/assets/cdn.prod.website-files.com/63f501f2fcfc599ea419f99b/63f501f3fcfc59d66a1a01e0_entreprise%20hero1.avif",
  "expertise-img-src": "/assets/cdn.prod.website-files.com/63f501f2fcfc599ea419f99b/63f501f3fcfc5917bc1a01e3_entreprise%2011.avif",
  "expertise-img-srcset": "/assets/cdn.prod.website-files.com/63f501f2fcfc599ea419f99b/63f501f3fcfc5917bc1a01e3_entreprise%252011-p-500.avif 500w, /assets/cdn.prod.website-files.com/63f501f2fcfc599ea419f99b/63f501f3fcfc5917bc1a01e3_entreprise%2011.avif 1000w",
  "title50px": "Demand the best of SaaS technology",
  "subtitle-hover-block-html": "\n            <p>Secure, easy to deploy and easy to use: rely on a state-of-the-art software solution that fits your company's IT architecture. </p>\n            <p>With the degraded mode, ensure your recovery services even in the event of a network outage.</p>\n          ",
  "title50px-2": "Take advantage of a customized solution",
  "subtitle-hover-block-html-2": "\n            <p>Set up the Innovorder collection system with the management rules (admission, subsidy) specific to your company. </p>\n            <p>Synchronize your HR or access control software easily and gain efficiency in every department.</p>\n          ",
  "expertise-img-src-2": "/assets/cdn.prod.website-files.com/63f501f2fcfc599ea419f99b/63f501f3fcfc5957e51a01d8_entreprise%2022.avif",
  "expertise-img-srcset-2": "/assets/cdn.prod.website-files.com/63f501f2fcfc599ea419f99b/63f501f3fcfc5957e51a01d8_entreprise%252022-p-500.avif 500w, /assets/cdn.prod.website-files.com/63f501f2fcfc599ea419f99b/63f501f3fcfc5957e51a01d8_entreprise%2022.avif 1000w",
  "expertise-img-src-3": "/assets/cdn.prod.website-files.com/63f501f2fcfc599ea419f99b/63f501f3fcfc592b7d1a01d6_entreprise%2033.avif",
  "expertise-img-srcset-3": "/assets/cdn.prod.website-files.com/63f501f2fcfc599ea419f99b/63f501f3fcfc592b7d1a01d6_entreprise%252033-p-500.avif 500w, /assets/cdn.prod.website-files.com/63f501f2fcfc599ea419f99b/63f501f3fcfc592b7d1a01d6_entreprise%2033.avif 1000w",
  "title50px-3": "Simplify the life of your kitchen teams",
  "subtitle-hover-block-html-3": "\n            <p>Easy to use, the Innovorder ecosystem interfaces with all the solutions that are essential to your business:</p>\n            <ul role=\"list\">\n              <li>access control</li>\n              <li>HR solutions</li>\n              <li>payroll management solution</li>\n              <li>production management</li>\n              <li>display solution</li>\n            </ul>\n            <p>Put digital technology to work for your restaurant and focus on your core business with complete peace of mind.</p>\n          ",
  "section-class": "section slider-kiosk-sect fidelite",
